{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-b2c83134-de10-4504-bc0b-6395265927ba-14\nfc_9fb0ac0b-7102-95d0-a118-3b7d0c99b907_4","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/zen-realtime-reasoning/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py","offset":3235,"limit":40},"result":{"success":{"content":"    r\"(?<![A-Za-z0-9_\\-])(?:st_|rt_|sk-|fk-)[A-Za-z0-9_\\-]{8,}\"\n    r\"|(?<![A-Za-z0-9_\\-])\"\n    r\"(?!(?:gemini-|mimo-|muse-|longcat-|deepseek-|claude-|opencode-|nemotron-|minimax-|beam-|glm-|qwen|chatcmpl-|call_|session-|org_|user_|acc_|wrk_))\"\n    r\"[A-Za-z0-9_\\-]{24,}\"\n)\n\n\ndef _mask_secrets(text: str) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Длинные токеноподобные последовательности -> ***; id моделей каталога и алиасов не маскируются.\"\"\"\n    def keep_model_ids(match: re.Match[str]) -> str:\n        token = match.group(0)\n        return token if token in ALLOWED_MODELS or token in MODEL_ALIASES else \"***\"\n\n    return _SECRET.sub(keep_model_ids, text)\n\n\n_MAX_EXTRA_BRACES = 16  # предел лишних `}` после полного объекта вызова\n\n\ndef _recover_trailing_braces(text: str, strict: bool, quiet: bool = False) -> dict[str, Any] | None:\n    \"\"\"Первый JSON-объект, за которым идут только пробелы и 1..16 лишних `}`; иначе None (холодный путь).\"\"\"\n    body = text.lstrip()\n    try:\n        obj, end = json.JSONDecoder(strict=strict).raw_decode(body)\n    except (ValueError, RecursionError):\n        return None\n    tail = body[end:]\n    extra = tail.count(\"}\")\n    if isinstance(obj, dict) and 1 <= extra <= _MAX_EXTRA_BRACES and not tail.strip(\" \\t\\r\\n}\"):\n        if not quiet:\n            _log(f\"tool_call_recovered extra_braces={extra}\")\n        return obj\n    return None\n\n\ndef _loads_lenient(text: str, *, quiet: bool = False) -> Any:\n    \"\"\"json.loads с допуском сырых управляющих символов (\\\\n, \\\\t) внутри строк и лишних `}` в хвосте.\n\n    Порт из droid-bridge (08.10): модели кладут многострочные команды в JSON-строку\n    без экранирования переводов строк; строгий json.loads их отвергает, и вызов","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":6288,"fileSize":285650,"path":"/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/zen-realtime-reasoning/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py","readRange":{"startLine":3235,"endLine":3274},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-b2c83134-de10-4504-bc0b-6395265927ba-14\nfc_9fb0ac0b-7102-95d0-a118-3b7d0c99b907_4","startedAtMs":"1793044827370","completedAtMs":"1793044827455"},"model_call_id":"83eaffa8-544d-4e2a-b603-69b0b69dfa9f-3-fha7","session_id":"ca9adcc0-f87e-42e4-a020-0dba1429619f","timestamp_ms":1793044827498}
